格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"ComfyUI 驱动器（AI-first 合同制）：模型只见合同槽、不见工作流 JSON。文生图/图生图/文生视频/图生视频模板，双重预检防幻觉，官方/自定义节点活体判定。","id":"gh:1337018402","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-comfyui","slug":"zeroa234/dsh-comfyui","topics":["agent-plugins","agent-tools","ai-agents","comfyui","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","image-generation","image-to-image","image-to-video","text-to-image","text-to-video","video-generation","workflow"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"ComfyUI 驱动器（AI-first 合同制）：模型只见合同槽、不见工作流 JSON。文生图/图生图/文生视频/图生视频模板，双重预检防幻觉，官方/自定义节点活体判定。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-comfyui · ComfyUI 驱动器（DeepSeek Harness）"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**AI-first 合同制 ComfyUI driver for DeepSeek Harness (dsh).**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"模型只看见合同（槽 / LoRA 坑 / can / cannot 能力标签），永远看不见工作流 JSON；人要改接线去真 ComfyUI。\nThe model only sees a contrac"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"t (slots / LoRA pits / can-cannot capability tags) — never the workflow JSON; rewiring happens in re"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"LoRA pits / can-cannot capability tags) — never the workflow JSON; rewiring happens in real ComfyUI."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"图生图 · 文生图 · 图生视频 · 文生视频：工作流扫描成合同 → 双击预检（节点存在性 + 模型文件）→ 失败如实报错，**不假出一张图**。\nImage-to-image · text-to-i"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"mage · image-to-video · text-to-video: scan a workflow into a contract → double preflight (node exis"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"tence + model files) → honest errors on failure, **no fabricated output**."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 特性 · Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> 工具注册名统一为 `_dsh_external_dsh_comfyui_*` 全名（harness 不做名字缩短，模型按注册名调用）。\n> Tool registration names are "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"the full `_dsh_external_dsh_comfyui_*` (the harness does not shorten names; the model calls the regi"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"_external_dsh_comfyui_*` (the harness does not shorten names; the model calls the registered names)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| 工具 Tool（注册名 Registration name） | 说明 Description |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| `_dsh_external_dsh_comfyui_list` | 连通状态 + 模板清单（media/mode/can/cannot + 用户写的 `user_note`）Connectivi"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ty + template list (media/mode plus user notes for the model) |\n| `_dsh_external_dsh_comfyui_inspect"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"` | 单个模板的槽 / LoRA 坑 / `prompt_style` / `user_note`，`query` 搜模型文件名 One template's slots / LoRA pits /"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" prompt style / user notes; `query` searches model filenames |\n| `_dsh_external_dsh_comfyui_generate"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"` | 按合同填槽提交。遵守 `user_note` 与 `prompt_style`（自然语言 vs tag）。图/视频/音频只传本地路径 Submit by contract. Follow us"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"er notes and prompt style. Media inputs take local paths |\n| `_dsh_external_dsh_comfyui_job` | 查询 / "},{"id":"p9s7","text":"等待 / 取消任务；成品只返回磁盘路径 Query / wait / cancel jobs; outputs are disk paths |\n| `_dsh_external_dsh_comfyu"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"i_import` | 扫描 / 导入本地 API Format JSON 为新模板（默认只扫描不落盘）Scan / import a local API-format JSON as a templ"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"ate (preview-only by default) |\n| `_dsh_external_dsh_comfyui_lora` | LoRA 注册表：`list` / `register` / "},{"id":"p9s10","text":"`remove` 触发词与用法注释（与设置页同一张表）LoRA registry: list/register/remove trigger words and usage notes (same t"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"设置页同一张表）LoRA registry: list/register/remove trigger words and usage notes (same table as Settings) |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 核心设计 · Core design"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### AI-first 合同制 · Contract-first, AI-blind to graphs"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **槽 = (node, field) 指针**：注入是通用的，合同 JSON 可以手补节点号——自动扫描漏掉的槽有万能逃生门。\nSlots are `(node, field)` pointer"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"s with generic injection; contracts are hand-editable as the universal escape hatch.\n- **槽类型封闭、工作流开放"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"**：text / number / seed / model / lora / image / video / audio 8 种封闭槽，任意 API 图都能扫成合同。\nClosed slot ty"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"pes (`text/number/seed/model/lora/image/video/audio`), open workflow set.\n- **双重预检**：先验节点 + 必填输入（`NO"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"DE_MISSING`/`NODE_SCHEMA_MISMATCH`），再验模型文件在服务器上（`MODEL_MISSING`）；全绿才 POST。失败返回结构化错误码（`SLOT_UNKNOWN`/"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"`PROMPT_REJECTED`/`MEDIA_MISSING`/`UI_FORMAT`…），不会用文生图冒充视频、不会编造成品。\nDouble preflight: node existence "},{"id":"p13s7","text":"+ required inputs, then model-file existence; structured error codes; honest failure."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 工作流适配 · Workflow adaptability"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| 类型 Type | 适配度 Adaptability | 证据 Evidence |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| 文生图 t2i / 图生图 i2i | ✅ 完全适配（成熟路径） | 随包 3 个 anima 模板，单测覆盖 |\n| 文生视频 t2v | ✅ 适配 | 测试 fixture 是真实 MiniM"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ax-H3 图：duration/fps/aspect_ratio/megapixels 槽、音频 VAE、`cannot: t2i` |\n| 图生视频 i2v | ✅ 适配（图里接了 LoadIma"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ge 即识别） | 实测探针：LoadImage → WanImageToVideo → VHS_VideoCombine 扫出 `mode: i2v` + 必填 image 槽 |\n| 音频相关 a"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"udio | 🟡 部分 | `LoadAudio`/`SaveAudio`/`VAEDecodeAudio` 识别，输出收集含 audio bag |\n| 聊天 / LLM 节点混合 | 🟡 能导入能"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"执行，无对话语义 | LLM 节点上游有标量文本时会被选为 prompt 槽；全内部化则诚实警告\"edit the contract\" |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### 官方 / 自定义节点判定 · Official vs custom node classification"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"每个节点的 `python_module` 标签就是权威来源：`nodes` / `comfy_extras.*` / `comfy_api_nodes.*` 是官方，`custom_nodes.<包"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"dule` 标签就是权威来源：`nodes` / `comfy_extras.*` / `comfy_api_nodes.*` 是官方，`custom_nodes.<包名>` 是自定义（带插件包名）。"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The `python_module` tag on every node is authoritative: `nodes` / `comfy_extras.*` / `comfy_api_node"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"s.*` are official; `custom_nodes.<pack>` is custom (pack name included)."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **生成时**：预检按 `python_module` 活体分类，返回 `custom_nodes: [{class_type, pack}]` —— 官方更新新节点**零维护自动跟随**。\nAt"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" generate time, preflight classifies live by `python_module` — new official nodes in ComfyUI updates"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" are followed automatically.\n- **导入时**：优先用活体会话分类（警告标注 `verified against the live server`）；离线时回退到 `li"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"b/lib/official-nodes.json`（849 个官方节点，由 `scripts/update-official-nodes.mjs` 从服务器生成，绝不手打）。\nAt import t"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"ime, live classification wins (warning marked `verified`); offline falls back to the generated 849-n"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"cation wins (warning marked `verified`); offline falls back to the generated 849-node official list."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## 安装 · Installation"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"仓库即标准 dsh bundle 包（`@dsh-external/dsh-comfyui`），克隆后直接安装："},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The repo is a standard dsh bundle package (`@dsh-external/dsh-comfyui`) — clone and install:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"安装后重启 harness，新会话的工具列表里就会出现 `_dsh_external_dsh_comfyui_*` 六个工具（bundle 自带的 `cordis.patch.yml` 会写入默认 b"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"aseUrl/outputDir）。设置页改动需要再重启一次才能刷新客户端打包。"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
